  "score": {
    "$description": "Score badges shade continuously across the tier palette by score: anchors at the band centers 1.95 (disliked), 5.2 (fine), 7.45 (liked), 9.25 (loved), clamped outside; tier band edges are 4.0, 6.5, 8.5 (see packages/core TIER_BANDS)."
